        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tig Mia is a beautifully renovated character residence in the peaceful townland of Skeaghanore West. This charming, whitewashed farmhouse is situated just 2km from the village of Ballydehob and approximately 15km from the market town of Skibbereen, placing some of West Cork's finest attractions within easy reach.\r\nOriginally renovated in 2006 with further upgrades in 2022, the property is presented in excellent condition throughout. Retaining much of its original character while incorporating modern comforts, Tig Mia offers an interesting blend of country charm and practical living. The property has delightful views across the surrounding countryside towards the sea.\r\nThe accommodation is both comfortable and inviting, comprising a well-appointed kitchen/dining room, a cosy living room, three bedrooms and two bathrooms.\r\nAlso forming part of the property is a farmhouse adjacent to Tig Mia currently undergoing works. This presents an opportunity for restoration and subject to eligibility and approval, may qualify for the Government's Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and other available renovation supports. The farmhouse offers potential to create further value and appeal. This is a rare combination of a beautifully renovated home together with a restoration project.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are currently completing the instillation of a timber frame Montana in the garden. See image attached. \r\nAlso under construction and near completion is a patio area with pergola which will be home to a sauna, outside shower, hot tub and outside kitchen area. \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-\tOil-fired central heating\r\n-\tCurrently mains water supply, well also on site if purchasers preference is to have private supply. \r\n-\tSeptic tank wastewater system\r\n\r\nTig Mia: \r\nKitchen / Dining: (3.7m x 5m) \r\nLiving Room: (6.3m x 3.3m) \r\nShower room: shower, wc, whb \r\nBedroom 1: (3.1m x 6.1m)\r\n\r\n1st floor landing: \r\nFamily bathroom: shower, wc, whb \r\nBedroom 2: (4m x 4m)\r\nBedroom 3: (2.2m x 3.9m) balcony with sea views \r\n\r\nCurrent layout of Farmhouse: \r\nKitchen \r\nOpen plan Dining/Living space \r\n1st floor: \r\nBedroom 1 \r\nBedroom 2 \r\nBathroom \r\nGround works in place for rear extension. \r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
